{{Documentation/Header}}
This template displays a user's avatar from UserProfileV2.

==Syntax==
=== Basic Usage ===
{{T|GetUserAvatar|Username}}

=== With Custom Size ===
{{T|GetUserAvatar|Username|size=100}}

=== With Custom Border Radius ===
{{T|GetUserAvatar|Username|size=150|radius=10px}}

==Examples==
* {{T|GetUserAvatar|Makudoumee|_Y_=1}}
* {{T|GetUserAvatar|Makudoumee|size=50|_Y_=1}}
* {{T|GetUserAvatar|Arknomahounorobotto|size=200|radius=0|_Y_=1}}

